# CODEOWNERS — open-install-library
# Rules evaluated bottom-up; most specific match wins.
# After merging: enable "Require review from Code Owners" in
# Settings → Branches → Edit (main).
#
# Hierarchy:
#
#   open-install-library/
#   ├── .github/           → virtuoso
#   ├── docs/              → virtuoso
#   ├── examples/          → virtuoso
#   ├── validator/         → virtuoso
#   ├── recipes/
#   │   └── newrelic/
#   │       ├── apm/
#   │       │   ├── dotNet/    → dotnet
